WEBVTT

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:09.280
It really was terrible yesterday...

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:16.280
I'm really glad Mikan didn't go to the mansion alone.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.620
Kujou-senpai!

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.120
This is... uh...

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.830
I was thinking I should thank you properly.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.710
Thank me?

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.090
Oh, no.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.510
I explained it to you when you woke up, didn't I?

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:35.840
The one who saved you was Yami.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:37.350
No.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:38.850
I'm sure of it.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:43.850
It was you who saved me then.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.020
Eh?

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:49.980
So... um... for the time being...

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:53.240
Thank you.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.450
T-That's all!

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:57.370
Ah, Senpai!

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.790
See, don't you feel better?

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.710
You have to speak up when you want to say something, right Rin?

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:14.420
Yes.

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:17.510
But to be honest, it's difficult to believe.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:20.470
You mean about Yuuki Rito saving me?

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:25.100
That too, but we've been together a long time and this is a first.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:28.020
Seeing you with an expression like that.

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:28.770
Wh-!?

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:29.940
I don't know what you mean.

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.820
It's fine, Rin!

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:35.530
I understand how it feels to be in love, so much that it hurts!

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:36.990
Saki-sama!

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.310
<b>fushigi na yasuragi kanshou</b>

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.310
<b>不思議な安らぎ観賞</b>

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.310
<b>This strange feeling of peaceful enjoyment</b>

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.890
<b>shibaraku kono mama</b>

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.890
<b>しばらくこのまま</b>

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.890
<b>Will continue for a while</b>

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:09.480
<b>rikai funou puroburemubousou</b>

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:09.480
<b>理解不能プロブレム暴走</b>

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:09.480
<b>An impossible to solve problem runs wild</b>

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:12.770
<b>genin wa?</b>

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:12.770
<b>原因は？</b>

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:12.770
<b>And the cause is?</b>

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:19.240
<b>kimi to iru to kudaranai oshie wasureru</b>

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:19.240
<b>君といるとくだらない教え忘れる</b>

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:19.240
<b>Whenever I'm with you, I forget all about these boring lessons</b>

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:27.040
<b>kono henka kara umaretahonshin ukeireyou</b>

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:27.040
<b>この変化から生まれた本心受け入れよう</b>

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:27.040
<b>I want you to accept the true feelings born from this change</b>

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:31.000
<b>harimegutta saisho no kokoro</b>

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:31.000
<b>張り巡った最初の心</b>

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:31.000
<b>I reeled in the first heart I could hook</b>

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.460
<b>taguriyose sotto seebushita</b>

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.460
<b>手繰り寄せそっとセーブした</b>

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.460
<b>Carefully saving it</b>

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:39.090
<b>hyouteki ni fukuzatsu na mune no yami takushite</b>

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:39.090
<b>標的に複雑な胸の闇託して</b>

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:39.090
<b>I use the complicated darkness in my heart on my target</b>

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.180
<b>Care me! Care me! Care me! Care me!</b>

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.180
<b></b>

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.180
<b></b>

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:48.180
<b>naiteru kokoro atatamete yatto kizuita</b>

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:48.180
<b>泣いてる心温めてやっと気づいた</b>

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:48.180
<b>As I warmed the crying heart, I finally realised</b>

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:57.030
<b>watashi no himitsu heiki wa nani yori mo tsuyoku katakumusunda</b>

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:57.030
<b>私の秘密兵器はなによりも強く硬く結んだ</b>

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:57.030
<b>That more than anything, my secret weapon is strongly, firmly bound</b>

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:00.280
<b>kimi to no tsunagari</b>

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:00.280
<b>君との繋がり</b>

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:00.280
<b>With my connection to you</b>

