00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.920
<b>「Kiss</b>

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.920
<b>「Kiss</b>

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.920
<b>~What Lies Beyond A Kiss~」</b>

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.920
<b>~What Lies Beyond A Kiss~」</b>

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.130
Your bust is charming, but...

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.630
...this is pretty nice.

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:21.720
He-!

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:22.970
Stop it, Risa!

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.140
Oh, how cold.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.180
Don't be stingy!

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.140
Yuuki's always touching them, isn't he?

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:32.730
I'm jealous, I wish someone would touch me too.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:33.980
Geez!

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.940
Stop saying that like Yuuki-kun is doing it intentionally!

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:41.030
What is it, Lala-sama?

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:45.570
I was wondering what I could do to close the distance between Haruna and Rito more...

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.080
Oh, that's what it was?

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.210
Why don't you just tell them that their love is mutual?

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.580
I can't do that!

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:56.340
They should hear something as important as that from each other.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:00.590
But Lala-sama, here's what I think...

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:01.880
Hm?

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:05.550
Lala-sama, are you satisfied with your love as it is now?

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:10.100
We know that Rito-dono's and your love is mutual, but...

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:16.520
...it seems love does not end at communicating each others' feelings.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:23.570
Haruna-dono is important, but shouldn't you be thinking about your own progress a little?

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.910
Mea.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.500
How has Golden Darkness been since then?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.540
There hasn't especially been much change.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:38.250
She came to school today like normal.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.750
Is that so?

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.710
The Demon Sword Bladix...

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.510
I wonder how she saw it.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:51.180
The true nature of a weapon that perpetuates nothing but conflict and casualty.

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:54.140
She should be aware of it as well...

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:55.980
Master?

00:04:55.980 --> 00:05:00.900
Could it be that it wasn't a coincidence that Bladix ended up at that mansion?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.360
Who knows?

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.740
I have a lot of free time on my hands.

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:12.120
Ah, Sensei!

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.420
I-I'm sorry!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.930
I was too preoccupied with carrying those notes!

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:28.760
N-No, I should have been more careful as well.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:29.430
Ah?

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.260
Yuuki Rito.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:37.480
You've been tripping a little too often recently.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.330
Rito! There you are!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.790
Wait, what's wrong?

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:57.580
Princess.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.120
Ah.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.630
Yami-chan!

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.040
Please don't fly so close.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:05.880
The level of this man's sexual harassment is becoming an ability.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:07.880
I have to crush him now while I can.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:08.630
Crush!?

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:10.680
I'm sorry!

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.760
I don't know what happened, but I don't think it was intentional.

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:16.060
Will you please forgive him?

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:19.650
If you insist that much, Princess...

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.070
...I'll overlook it just this once.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.400
Are you okay?

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.610
Thank you, Lala.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.030
You saved me.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:33.580
So Rito, there's something I want to talk about-

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:33.580
Oh, no!

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.580
I was in the middle of carrying notes.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:38.540
I have to properly apologise to Tearju-sensei, as well.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.540
Ah!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:40.210
Ah...

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.330
It looks like the timing was bad.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.720
If you're looking for Rito-san, he isn't here, Nana.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:53.550
What are you doing so suddenly, Momo!?

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:58.140
I-I just got a little lost and ended up here.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.730
That's a bit of a stretch, isn't it?

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:05.020
But... it seems Nana has become quite a bit more interested in Rito-san.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.530
Well, that's to be expected.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:24.250
What am I getting down about?

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.090
If Nana becomes a member of the harem,

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:28.590
shouldn't I be happy about it?

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:31.260
The more people around Rito-san that love him,

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:35.890
the more likely the harem becomes the only solution, too.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.180
Hmmm...

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:40.350
But how should I say it to Rito?

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:43.730
I don't know much about human love either, so...

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.020
Onee-sama?

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.530
Progress with Rito-san?

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:49.400
Yeah.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:53.030
Peke was worried if I was satisfied with things as they are now.

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.030
Yes.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:59.580
Despite knowing they love each other, Lala-sama and Rito-dono don't appear to be making any progress.

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:03.920
Well, that's because I think getting
Haruna and Rito together comes first.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:08.590
That's why I'm asking if you're okay with just that...

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:09.800
Certainly...

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:14.550
The harem plan won't be feasible if Onee-sama isn't in the legal wife position.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:18.810
It may be a good idea to have her be a little more aggressive.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:23.940
I think that it isn't good as it is right now as well.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:29.730
You finally fell in love, but if there's no stimulation for your partner, he could fall out of love.

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:30.320
Eh?!

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.740
I-Is that true?!

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:36.240
I think it would be good for you to show how much you love him more!

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.530
Goodbye, Celine-chan.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:44.250
Don't think you can do shameless things just because I won't be around after school.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.130
I won't!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.880
Oh, Sairenji.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:49.880
Yuuki-kun.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.130
Did you come to get Celine-chan?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.260
Y-Yeah.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.130
You have club activities, right Sairenji?

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.680
W-What about Momioka and the others?

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.480
She said she wanted to go to karaoke,
so she's taking a break from club activities.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.480
I see.

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:06.730
They're so impulsive, aren't they?

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:10.770
Haruna should just confess too...

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:11.860
Lala-sama!

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:14.900
You're supposed to be thinking of yourself rather than other people right now!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.860
I-I know.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.490
Hey, Lala!

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:25.080
It's fine to hold arms once in a while, isn't it?

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:28.290
What's with big sister suddenly?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:29.790
No idea.

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:32.920
If you're jealous, why don't you take the other arm?

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.340
Why would I?!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.300
It has nothing to do with me!

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:39.720
Rito's warmth!

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:41.810
It feels like it's been a while!

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:43.810
It makes me feel so at ease!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:45.810
I'm home.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.310
Rito!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:48.650
Hey!

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.810
You're too close!

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:54.360
Huh? This mood feels sort of nostalgic.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.690
Well, I guess it's fine.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:58.030
Lala-san is just a child, after all.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.950
Rito~

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:03.410
Onee-sama... just as I thought.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.210
What is it, Momo?

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.620
You said you wanted to show me something in your room?

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.170
Onee-sama.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:14.840
Teaching something like this to a pure person like Onee-sama is...

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:15.880
But...

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:19.640
As it stands now, it's no good.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.140
I borrowed this.

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:25.140
It's something you need for the sake of your progress with Rito-san.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.480
Oh, what is it? A game?

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:30.150
Yes.

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:33.360
It's an Earth game that allows you to simulate love.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:37.900
Nozomi

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:37.900
「Eh-! H- Here? But- ...Okay, Senpai-」

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.900
I've already completed this heroine's route, so she's dere-dere.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.320
Route...?

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:42.160
I can go into her event scene as a lover at any time.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.330
Event...?

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.870
I'll teach Onee-sama!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.330
The adult way of expressing love!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.880
Ah...

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:58.220
Lala was kind of strange today.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:02.050
No. She was more like the way she used to be.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:07.100
Hm?

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.600
W-What?!

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:09.810
What's-?!

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.230
Ah.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.110
Lala!?

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:13.980
Why are you-

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.570
Why- w-wha- how-?!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:19.150
I thought I'd get in the bath with you, Rito!

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:22.660
B-But why did you have to warp in so suddenly?

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.290
Where are you looking?!

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.420
Ah, sorry.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:36.090
I was just thinking I haven't seen you naked very much.

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:40.800
What's with those really interested-looking eyes?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:43.220
They're different from just a bit ago!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.930
I-I'm getting out!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.100
Ah! Wait!

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.940
Please, wait.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.440
Rito...

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:59.860
The truth is, I came for a different reason.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:12.750
Before I met you I'd never been in love, so I had no idea
how two people in love should be or what they should do.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.670
Two people in love...?

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.040
Onee-sama.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.380
I know!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.760
The one you love the most is Haruna, right?

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:23.470
But you also love me, Rito.

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:25.180
Isn't that right?

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.600
Rito, has the way you feel changed?

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:33.640
Do you still love me?

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:43.740
If that's the case... I want to try kissing.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:54.000
I want to try kissing.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:55.870
Onee-sama!

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.750
I didn't think she'd do something like this suddenly!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.510
Momo, is this...?

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:03.260
Yes.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:06.180
This is the universal expression of love.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:07.930
A kiss.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.470
I see!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:14.270
Now that I think about it, ever since we were little, Mama would often smooch us on the cheek.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:15.600
Yes.

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:19.940
Because the best way to express love to someone dear to you is a kiss.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:26.410
Kissing is also used between men and women in love to confirm their love for each other.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:30.950
It's a special kiss where you put your lips together!

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:40.540
The moment their love is conveyed, the two of them feel the greatest sense of happiness, Onee-sama.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.840
A-And after that...

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.970
I'll keep going and teach her everything right now!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:50.180
So that Onee-sama and Rito-san can proceed to the next step...!

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:55.980
Huh?

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:56.940
What?

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:58.350
I can't do it!

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:02.070
To show Onee-sama, who is so pure, any more than this...

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:03.530
Oh, there you are!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.110
Is it over?

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:11.830
In the end, I was unable to teach 
Onee-sama about what lies beyond a kiss.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:14.200
But even with only that...!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:17.080
Lala, kissing so suddenly is...

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.000
Even though I only taught her about kissing...!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:22.170
Do you not love me?

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.630
N-No, it's not that.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:25.880
I'm so glad.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:27.340
Then...

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:33.600
Do you want to do it?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.810
What is this overwhelming devilish aura?!

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:40.940
What's more, it's a natural, unplanned devilishness!

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:45.110
If Onee-sama goes beyond a kiss...!

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:47.110
Hey-! Wait-!

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:57.830
Ah!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:03.000
Geez, not there!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.090
What I want you to kiss is my lips!

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:05.710
Hm?

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:10.880
Rito! Rito! Get a hold of yourself!

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:13.220
Hey! Rito...!

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:13.220
As expected of Rito-san.

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:14.970
Hey...!

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:14.970
He's not losing to her.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.220
I'm sorry.

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:19.230
Rito, are you okay?

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:20.600
Y-Yeah.

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:23.810
I'm going to go do homework in my room.

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:25.270
Yeah...

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:27.940
Rito-san...

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:29.240
Momo!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.490
I'm sorry!

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:33.320
What Onee-sama did... was because of me.

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:37.330
I see...

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:39.660
So you taught Lala about kissing.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:40.830
Yes.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:43.420
I thought it was strange.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:45.460
That Lala would do that suddenly.

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:48.920
But I think it's because her feelings were that strong...

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:52.260
As soon as she learned something new, she wanted to try it with you, Rito-san.

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:54.090
Those feelings...

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:56.810
Even I...

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:57.560
Hm?

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.640
Ah, it's nothing!

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:04.310
At any rate, that's how serious Onee-sama is!

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:08.820
Serious...?

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.030
Here we go!

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:11.190
And-!

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:13.200
Smooch!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.700
You think it's like that, Peke?

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.700
I don't understand very well, but I think it's something like that.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:22.000
Special kiss!

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:26.000
I didn't know that a kiss was something that special!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.420
Oh, Nana-sama.

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:28.210
Nana!

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.130
Eh... Uh...

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.760
What are you doing, big sister?

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:35.300
Practising kissing Rito!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:36.760
Kissing?!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:37.890
W-What are you saying?!

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:39.180
You're not even married yet!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:40.520
Ah...

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:45.900
But Momo told me that people who love each other kiss on the lips.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:46.560
Eh...?

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:49.070
People who love each other?

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:51.530
Rito and you do, big sister?

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:53.150
Oh, that's right.

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:56.450
I haven't told you about what happened at the pool, have I?

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:04.830
I want to try kissing.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:06.750
Yuuki-kun...

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:08.960
Yuuki-kun.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:15.380
That tickles, Yuuki-kun.

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:18.720
Sa-

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:20.680
Sairenji!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.270
Why are you here?!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.100
Can I kiss you?

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:28.730
Ah-! I-! But-!

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:44.750
I'm finally doing it with Haruna-chan...

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:54.460
I'm so happy, Rito.

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:55.880
Congratulations, Lala-san!

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:56.840
It's not fair!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.510
I love Rito-kun, too!

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:00.430
Run!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.930
For once, Momo-san isn't here, but...

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.940
What kind of dream were you having?

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:09.230
Your miso soup is going to get cold.

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:14.730
What a dream!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:17.740
Oh! What's this, what's this?

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:19.240
Run-chan's new song?

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:22.030
Run-chan's really working hard!

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.040
Rito!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.960
W-What did you want, suddenly?

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:39.680
Um... There's something I want to know.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.640
Something you want to know?

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:45.140
Your feelings.

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:49.770
As I thought, this is a continuation of the kiss.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:52.270
But I...

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:54.070
I...

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.490
Rito, um...

00:18:58.490 --> 00:18:59.740
I'm sorry!

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:06.080
I... I can't kiss you!

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:12.290
I-I mean... Um...

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:15.840
Kissing is something lovers do.

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:20.050
We're not in that kind of relationship yet, so...

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:23.180
It's true that I love you, Lala, but...

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:26.680
But my feelings for Sairenji haven't changed...

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:32.560
But I can't accept the idea of marrying both of you because of that no matter what.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:35.940
To be honest, I haven't come to a conclusion for myself.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:42.360
If I accept a kiss with these half-hearted feelings, I'll become even more useless.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:43.620
So that's why...!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:47.740
As I thought!

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:49.830
It's just as Nana said isn't it, Peke?

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:50.540
Eh?

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.920
It appears so, Lala-sama.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:53.580
Nana...?

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.960
What are you talking about?

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:59.170
I spoke to Nana yesterday.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.680
Rito loves Haruna and you?

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:03.390
Yeah.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.010
I'm sorry for not telling you.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:08.970
In any case Lala-sama, you'll succeed next time for sure!

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.100
Yeah.

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:14.100
But Rito didn't seem like he wanted to do it very much.

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:17.440
I understand Rito's feelings.

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:18.610
Nana?

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:25.450
I mean... Rito still isn't accepting your idea of marrying you both, right?

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:29.660
If it were me, in those circumstances suddenly talking about, um...

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:34.040
...kissing, I don't think my heart would be ready.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.210
Nana said that...?

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.210
I'm sorry, Rito.

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:43.010
I was in high spirits because I just learned about kissing.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:46.340
I felt like I had to try it with the person who I love,

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.720
but I didn't think of your feelings.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:50.520
So...

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:59.110
These are my feelings.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:03.360
If one day you'll answer my feelings...

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:07.490
Then I'll be waiting for it... your special kiss!

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:10.240
Lala...

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:11.040
Ah!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.790
And of course it's okay if it's after you get together with Haruna!

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.000
You don't understand after all!?

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:20.210
I just can't beat Onee-sama...

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.260
But...

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:31.680
Why do I feel like this?!

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:35.390
Who Rito loves has nothing to do with me, right?!

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:36.520
Nana.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:38.400
Momo?

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:42.980
It seems you heard about Rito-san from Onee-sama.

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:43.530
Eh?

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:45.240
S-So what?!

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:46.780
I'm not really...!

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:50.240
I think it might be okay to tell you about it now.

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:51.530
About what?

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:53.950
My plan.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:55.290
Eh?

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:14.270
<b>niwasaki yureru hana ga tsun to senobi de kotaeru</b>

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:14.270
<b>庭先揺れる花がツンと背伸びで応える</b>

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:14.270
<b>The flower swaying in the garden answers by stretching up</b>

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:19.900
<b>tsumasakidachi de asa ni ohayou no kisu</b>

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:19.900
<b>つま先立ちで朝におはようのKiss</b>

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:19.900
<b>To give a good morning kiss standing on tiptoes</b>

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:22.820
<b>saa yukou</b>

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:22.820
<b>さあ行こう</b>

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:22.820
<b>Now let's go!</b>

00:22:22.570 --> 00:22:29.610
<b>fui ni tsumujikaze omowazu shagamikomu</b>

00:22:22.570 --> 00:22:29.610
<b>不意につむじ風思わずしゃがみ込む</b>

00:22:22.570 --> 00:22:29.610
<b>Caught off guard by the sudden whirlwind, I reflexively crouch down</b>

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:41.920
<b>fuwari sukaato ni kakushita yowasatsuyoku haratte miseta</b>

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:41.920
<b>ふわりスカートに隠した弱さ 強く払ってみせた</b>

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:41.920
<b>I firmly brush off the weakness hidden inside my skirt</b>

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:50.970
<b>fuzoroi de sainan na nichijou ni sakihokorou</b>

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:50.970
<b>不揃いで災難な日常に咲き誇ろう</b>

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:50.970
<b>Let's bloom to our fullest in this strange everyday life full of misfortune</b>

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:59.140
<b>sunao ni sodatanai kara chanto mitenakucha</b>

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:59.140
<b>素直に育たないからちゃんと見てなくちゃ</b>

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:59.140
<b>I can't be honest, so you have to pay close attention</b>

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:07.150
<b>tameratta ano omoi sotto tsuchi ni umetanda</b>

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:07.150
<b>躊躇ったあの想いそっと土に埋めたんだ</b>

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:07.150
<b>I carefully buried the memory of my hesitance in the soil</b>

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:13.410
<b>A flower blooming in your heart</b>

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:18.710
<b>sono hi o yume mite</b>

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:18.710
<b>その日を夢見て</b>

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:18.710
<b>I dream of that day</b>

